From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 20:27:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] book: add doc-region markers for the OpenGL renderer
 chapter

Comment-only. Adds // doc-region-begin/end <name> markers so the imps GZDoom
book's OpenGL renderer chapter can literalinclude source spans by NAME
(drift-proof), never line numbers.

Spans marked (the shared hardware renderer feeding the GL backend, then the GL
backend itself):
  src/common/rendering/hwrenderer/data/hw_renderstate.h   renderstate_draw_api
  src/rendering/hwrenderer/hw_entrypoint.cpp              render_one_viewpoint
  src/rendering/hwrenderer/scene/hw_drawinfo.cpp          process_scene, draw_scene,
                                                          create_scene, render_scene
  src/common/rendering/gl/gl_renderstate.cpp             gl_apply, gl_draw
  src/common/rendering/gl/gl_framebuffer.cpp             gl_frame_update

No code changes; proven comment-only by tools/prove_comment_only.sh.
---
 src/common/rendering/gl/gl_framebuffer.cpp            | 2 ++
 src/common/rendering/gl/gl_renderstate.cpp            | 4 ++++
 src/common/rendering/hwrenderer/data/hw_renderstate.h | 2 ++
 src/rendering/hwrenderer/hw_entrypoint.cpp            | 2 ++
 src/rendering/hwrenderer/scene/hw_drawinfo.cpp        | 8 ++++++++
 5 files changed, 18 insertions(+)

